                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Imagine an Ableton Push blown up to the size of a wall and you'll know exactly what this is and just how much you can do with it.\n\nThis is very nicely done indeed. \n\nAliveInVR is implemented as a standard Ableton MIDI controller which means you can pretty much grab any of your existing sets, jump right in and know what's going on.\n\nA little fiddly to get setup initially but that's the price of working with Ableton & MIDI.",
